# Working copies and throwaway config dirs are large and machine-specific. Rows
# ARE committed — they are the evidence the write-ups cite, and rows-regraded/
# carries `regradedFrom` so any oracle correction stays auditable. Representative
# transcripts are committed under probes/*/transcripts/ as oracle regression
# fixtures; the full per-trial stream-json is not.
evals/runs/*/trials/
evals/runs/*/transcripts/
evals/runs/*/cfg/
evals/runs/smoke*/
node_modules/
.DS_Store
